Cell["\<\
So the plot that was shown in the previous section was not the full story, \
some states can be quadrature squeezed when you measure them in the right \
squeezing axis\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9679149503259525`*^9, 3.9679150515966244`*^9}, {
