Cell["\<\
The curve dips to a third of shot noise in one direction and pays for it with \
two and a half times shot noise in the other approximately:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->25296630,ExpressionUUID->"e4a2ba34-4991-c845-8eae-04d0dd227425"],

