   {"SqueezeOperator", " ", Cell["\<\
represents a quantum operator that applies squeezing to any 
single mode state\
\>", "VocabularyText",ExpressionUUID->"9cd1cd85-cea4-684b-bcdf-f36501486441"]},
   {"CatState", " ", Cell["\<\
